  "text": "电池热管理与功率请求跟踪. 在高环境温度和持续功率请求下，控制器应通过冷却与功率降额将电池核心温度限制在安全范围内，同时保持SOC与电压合理。. Scenario time window 0s to 1200s; inputs: ambient_temp_C, driver_power_request_W_profile; initial conditions: T_core_C, T_surface_C, coolant_temp_C, soc. Acceptance criteria: max(T_core_C) <= 55.0; min(soc) >= 0.2; within_range(voltage_V) in [280.0, 420.0]; within_range(pump_cmd) in [0.0, 1.0]; within_range(fan_cmd) in [0.0, 1.0]. Signals of interest: driver_power_request_W, current_A, voltage_V, soc, T_core_C, T_surface_C, coolant_in_temp_C, coolant_flow_kgps, pump_cmd, fan_cmd Verification should conclude pass only when the co-simulation runs to completion and satisfies every acceptance criterion on the monitored signals.",
